  "about": {
    "title": "About Rollo Insurance",
    "text": [
      "While the insurance world moves toward commoditization and impersonality, we are doubling down on the time-tested virtues that strengthen our communities.",
      "We've grown slowly, but mightily, so that each of our 60+ offices has deep roots in its community—odds are your local agent is someone you would run into at a ball game or the grocery store. Luckily old-fashioned values doesn't mean antiquated methods. We never stop improving and adapting to the demands of tomorrow's landscape.",
